l}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\">\\(\\mathcal K\\)</span> is a class of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>-structures and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> is sourced from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"56c1f813209c75e1\" href=\"?note=56c1f813209c75e1\" title=\"93-df-first-order-satisfaction\">93-df-first-order-satisfaction</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}\\)</span> is the first-order structure predicate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathcal K,\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathcal K,\\mathcal L}\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semantic\\text{-}consequence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathfrak A:\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semantic\\text{-}consequence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathfrak A:\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semantic\\text{-}consequence}\\vdash\n\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathcal K,\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\forall s\\in|\\mathfrak A|^{\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\forall\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\gamma[s])\n\\to\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi[s]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semantic\\text{-}consequence}\\vdash\n\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathcal K,\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\forall s\\in|\\mathfrak A|^{\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\forall\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\gamma[s])\n\\to\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi[s]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A single assignment is held fixed across premises and conclusion. This is the correct consequence relation for possibly open first-order formulas.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-first-order-formula","status":"resolved","id":"84c35fea1e867240","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-structure","status":"resolved","id":"0ce709e0d2857990","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"56c1f813209c75e1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 